          {
            "section_type": "example_question",
            "normalized_html": "<p>Calculate <span class=\"math\">[MATH: A+B,]</span> where</p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: [1|\u2212 5; \u2212 2|3]]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "Calculate [MATH: A+B,] where\n\n[MATH: [1|\u2212 5; \u2212 2|3]]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "content",
            "normalized_html": "<p>EXPLANATION</p>",
            "readable_text": "EXPLANATION",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          },
          {
            "section_type": "example_explanation",
            "normalized_html": "<p>We add the corresponding entries:</p><p><span class=\"math\">[MATH: A + B|= [1|\u2212 5; \u2212 2|3] + [\u2212 10|2; 2|\u2212 4]; = [1 \u2212 10|\u2212 5 + 2; \u2212 2 + 2|3 \u2212 4]; = [\u2212 9|\u2212 3; 0|\u2212 1]]</span></p>",
            "readable_text": "We add the corresponding entries:\n\n[MATH: A + B|= [1|\u2212 5; \u2212 2|3] + [\u2212 10|2; 2|\u2212 4]; = [1 \u2212 10|\u2212 5 + 2; \u2212 2 + 2|3 \u2212 4]; = [\u2212 9|\u2212 3; 0|\u2212 1]]",
            "images": [],
            "free_entry_blanks": [],
            "select_lists": []
          }
