        "readable_text": "Prompt:\nCalculate [MATH: P \u2212 Q], where\n[MATH: P = [4|3; 1|2], Q = [1|2; 3|4].]\n\nChoices:\na. [MATH: [3|1; \u2212 2|\u2212 2]]\nb. [MATH: [3|1; 2|2]]\nc. [MATH: [\u2212 2|\u2212 2; 1|3]]\nd. [MATH: [2|2; \u2212 2|\u2212 2]]\ne. [MATH: [\u2212 2|\u2212 2; 3|1]]"
